-
-    1   arabic numbers      1, 2, 3, ...
-    a   lower alpha         a, b, c, ...
-    A   upper alpha         A, B, C, ...
-    i   lower roman         i, ii, iii, ...
-    I   upper roman         I, II, III, ...
-
-    The style is applied to the sequence number which by default
-    is reset to 1 for the first list item in an ordered list.
