-<!ELEMENT address %Inline;>
-<!ATTLIST address
-  %attrs;
-  >
-
-<!--=================== Horizontal Rule ==================================-->
-
-<!ELEMENT hr EMPTY>
-<!ATTLIST hr
-  %attrs;
-  >
